:KnowledgeGraph a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "SERA-AIMS benchmark knowledge graph"@en ;
    dcterms:references <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23260961> ;
    rdfs:comment "The half-scale stone masonry aggregate tested on the shake table within the SERA-AIMS project, the benchmark of this thesis, described with the Historic Survey (HSV), Historic Structure (HSTO) and Historic Masonry (HMO) ontologies: the publications and the BIM model, the units, façades and the interface between them, and the mechanical properties of the masonry derived by a reasoner from its published description, next to the measured ones. Built on HSV, HSTO and HMO. Quality indices and homogenised properties were derived by Pellet from the HMO rules (resources/ontologies/hmo.ttl) and checked against core/ifc_processing/hmo_mqi.py."@en ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/hmo>,
        <https://w3id.org/hsto>,
        <https://w3id.org/hsv> .

